import{_ as n,o as s,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 806 | Transcended Ones and Consciousness · Overview — The Transcended One's Consciousness-Domain Operation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 806 | Transcended Ones and Consciousness · Overview — The Transcended One's Consciousness-Domain Operation","no":806,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Consciousness","Consciousness Domain","Overview","Alaya Network"],"related":["21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles","14-Cultivation-Realm Unified Division","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0806_模块4-超脱者与意识-总论.md","filePath":"en/0806_模块4-超脱者与意识-总论.md"}`),t={name:"en/0806_模块4-超脱者与意识-总论.md"};function a(r,e,c,d,l,u){return s(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-806-transcended-ones-and-consciousness-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-consciousness-domain-operation" tabindex="-1">Entry 806 | Transcended Ones and Consciousness · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Consciousness-Domain Operation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-806-transcended-ones-and-consciousness-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-consciousness-domain-operation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 806 | Transcended Ones and Consciousness · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Consciousness-Domain Operation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 14, 26</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-an-island-of-consciousness-but-the-consciousness-domain-s-hub" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one is not an island of consciousness, but the consciousness domain&#39;s hub <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-an-island-of-consciousness-but-the-consciousness-domain-s-hub" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one is not an island of consciousness, but the consciousness domain&#39;s hub&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s imagination of &quot;the strong one&#39;s consciousness&quot; is: the strong one&#39;s mental power crushes everything, his consciousness covers the world, all beings are like ants under his consciousness shadow. This imagination treats consciousness as another kind of violent weapon — a fist more advanced than the fist. Heng Yuan Zhou completely negates this definition. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s orthodox framework, <strong>the transcended one&#39;s consciousness is not a weapon, but the highest node in the consciousness domain, this Myriad-Rank shared space</strong> — his consciousness&#39;s depth, breadth, and precision far exceed ordinary cultivators, but his consciousness&#39;s existence itself is to serve the common evolution of Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness, not to rule Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all take effect in this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires the transcended one not invade, control, or devour others&#39; consciousness; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the consciousness domain open access equally to all Myriad-Rank consciousness beings; the collective ascension axiom requires the transcended one&#39;s consciousness depth feed back the common uplift of Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness; the causal self-discipline axiom restrains the transcended one in cross-plane consciousness operations from strictly reporting and not disturbing others&#39; consciousness causality; the law-first axiom ensures the consciousness domain&#39;s operating rules themselves are law-level definitions, not changed by plot convenience.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article, as the &quot;Transcended Ones and Consciousness&quot; sub-series overview, sorts out the transcended one&#39;s consciousness-domain operation panorama at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm level.</p><h2 id="i-the-consciousness-domain-s-four-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. The Consciousness Domain&#39;s Four-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-consciousness-domain-s-four-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Consciousness Domain&#39;s Four-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Cultivation-Realm Unified Division (Document 14), Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmos structure divides into four layers: material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law network. The consciousness domain is the third layer, the public space for all consciousness activity. The transcended one&#39;s consciousness-domain operation from inside to outside divides into four layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Name</th><th>Operation Content</th><th>Corresponding Realm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Layer 1</td><td>Individual consciousness layer</td><td>Personal consciousness&#39;s stabilization, expansion, self-consistency</td><td>Sense to Transform</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 2</td><td>Group consciousness layer</td><td>Consciousness resonance with fellow cultivators, teachers, clans</td><td>Law to Dao Origin</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 3</td><td>Plane consciousness layer</td><td>Access the plane core anchor&#39;s consciousness-domain interface, participate in plane-level consciousness ecology</td><td>Dao Integration to Boundary-Breaking</td></tr><tr><td>Layer 4</td><td>Hyper-multiverse consciousness layer</td><td>Access Alaya Network&#39;s consciousness trunk, participate in cross-plane consciousness network operation</td><td>World-Creation to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Ordinary cultivators throughout their lives mainly operate in layers 1 and 2; plane-sovereign strong ones enter layer 3; the transcended one entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm operates in layer 4. Layer 4&#39;s core task is not &quot;stronger mental power,&quot; but <strong>maintaining the consciousness domain&#39;s, this public space&#39;s, health and prosperity</strong>.</p><h2 id="ii-the-transcended-one-s-five-core-functions-in-the-consciousness-domain" tabindex="-1">II. The Transcended One&#39;s Five Core Functions in the Consciousness Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-transcended-one-s-five-core-functions-in-the-consciousness-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Transcended One&#39;s Five Core Functions in the Consciousness Domain&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one in layer-4 consciousness-domain operation bears five core functions:</p><ol><li><strong>Consciousness-domain infrastructure maintenance</strong>: maintain the consciousness domain&#39;s underlying channels, ensuring all Myriad-Rank consciousness beings may stably access — this is &quot;everyone has a road&quot; at the consciousness-domain layer;</li><li><strong>Consciousness-pollution cleanup</strong>: clean residual predation-ism ideology, extreme thought viruses, and historical-regression concepts in the consciousness domain — preventing the old era&#39;s consciousness toxins polluting new generations;</li><li><strong>Consciousness-uplift guidance</strong>: provide consciousness-level guidance and protection for Myriad-Rank cultivators in the mortal-cultivation stage, preventing qi deviation and consciousness collapse;</li><li><strong>Cross-plane consciousness bridge</strong>: establish safe channels between different planes&#39; consciousness domains, enabling consciousness beings in different cosmic structures to communicate peacefully;</li><li><strong>Consciousness archive guardianship</strong>: guard Myriad Ranks&#39; collective-consciousness archives stored in Alaya Network — past cultivators&#39; enlightenment records, civilizational memories, historical lessons, ensuring this knowledge is not lost or tampered.</li></ol><p>Five functions&#39; common trait: <strong>all are service-type work, not rule-type power.</strong> The transcended one&#39;s status in the consciousness domain is like a library curator — he guards the most precious knowledge, but he may not decide who may read what books, much less stuff ideas into others&#39; heads.</p><h2 id="iii-consciousness-operation-s-boundaries-no-invasion-no-control-no-devouring" tabindex="-1">III. Consciousness Operation&#39;s Boundaries: No Invasion, No Control, No Devouring <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-consciousness-operation-s-boundaries-no-invasion-no-control-no-devouring" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Consciousness Operation&#39;s Boundaries: No Invasion, No Control, No Devouring&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness-dimension predation is more hidden and more dangerous than energy-dimension predation — energy predation is visible; consciousness predation is invisible. Heng Yuan Zhou draws three impassable red lines for the transcended one&#39;s consciousness operation:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not invade others&#39; consciousness</strong>: without the other party&#39;s explicit voluntary consent, the transcended one may not read, scan, or modify others&#39; consciousness content. What ethical review calls &quot;deep consciousness scan&quot; must be premised on the cultivator&#39;s full informed consent;</li><li><strong>Do not control others&#39; will</strong>: the transcended one may not affect others&#39; autonomous decisions by any means such as mental power, consciousness implantation, or emotion manipulation. Influence may be achieved through education, demonstration, and sharing, but absolutely not through direct consciousness intervention;</li><li><strong>Do not devour others&#39; consciousness</strong>: this is a complete prohibition on old-system predatory consciousness manuals such as &quot;primordial-spirit devouring&quot; and &quot;body-seizure.&quot; Consciousness devouring is the heaviest predation at the consciousness dimension; once discovered, law-anchor authority is immediately permanently revoked.</li></ul><p>Three red lines are enforced by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: every cross-individual consciousness contact in the consciousness domain leaves a record; abnormal patterns auto-trigger review. No matter how strong the transcended one&#39;s consciousness, he may not cross these three lines — this is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s technicalized implementation at the consciousness dimension.</p><h2 id="iv-the-consciousness-domain-s-myriad-rank-sharing-why-the-strong-one-s-consciousness-depth-must-feed-back" tabindex="-1">IV. The Consciousness Domain&#39;s Myriad-Rank Sharing: Why the Strong One&#39;s Consciousness Depth Must Feed Back <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-consciousness-domain-s-myriad-rank-sharing-why-the-strong-one-s-consciousness-depth-must-feed-back" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Consciousness Domain&#39;s Myriad-Rank Sharing: Why the Strong One&#39;s Consciousness Depth Must Feed Back&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the consciousness domain open to all consciousness beings. This means the transcended one&#39;s consciousness depth is not a private asset, but part of Myriad Ranks&#39; shared resources. Concrete mechanism:</p><ul><li><strong>Enlightenment results public</strong>: enlightenment insights the transcended one gains during consciousness uplift, after being organized by Alaya Network, enter the Selfless Dao public library, for Myriad-Rank cultivators to learn and reference;</li><li><strong>Consciousness resonance open</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s stable existence itself in the consciousness domain is a resonance source — low-order cultivators may through consciousness resonance with the transcended one gain consciousness stability and direction, accelerating their own consciousness growth;</li><li><strong>Consciousness safe haven</strong>: when the consciousness domain suffers abnormal impact (such as consciousness storms, concept pollution), the transcended one bears first-time shelter duty, protecting ordinary cultivators&#39; consciousness from damage.</li></ul><p>This mechanism converts the transcended one&#39;s consciousness depth into Myriad Ranks&#39; public consciousness safety net. The stronger he is, the denser the net; the deeper he is, the better Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness-growth environment.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: consciousness-domain infrastructure maintenance avoids wasteful congestion of consciousness channels; consciousness-pollution cleanup prevents old toxins from无效-consuming new generations</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: three red lines (no invasion, no control, no devouring) seal consciousness-dimension predatory channels at the law level</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, strong ones crush all beings&#39; consciousness with mental power; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one protects Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness with consciousness depth — the former is a tyrant, the latter is a gardener</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: consciousness-domain access opens to all Myriad-Rank five-lineage consciousness beings; carbon-based humankind, energy-condensed clans, mechanical-constructed clans, consciousness-information clans, mixed-mutated clans all have a road</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: consciousness-domain operating rules, consciousness-archive catalog, and enlightenment-results library are all public; Myriad Ranks may consult, learn, and reproduce</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s consciousness-domain operation is essentially shouldering maintenance of Myriad Ranks&#39; shared consciousness space. He is not the consciousness domain&#39;s conqueror, but its gardener — he cultivates the consciousness domain&#39;s soil, weeds its weeds, guards its seeds. The deeper, more stable, and broader his consciousness, the safer and more fertile Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness-growth environment. This is &quot;transcendence&quot; at the consciousness dimension&#39;s orthodox definition: not leaving all beings&#39; consciousness, but holding the common sky of all beings&#39; consciousness higher.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">Entry 14 · Cultivation-Realm Unified Division</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/801_模块4-超脱者与能量-总论.html">Entry 801 · Transcended Ones and Energy Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=n(t,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
